#: includes/Members/Privacy.php:170
msgid "Encrypted; this site’s current key cannot open it (it was saved under another key)."
msgstr "已加密；本站目前的金鑰無法開啟（這筆是用別的金鑰存的）。"

#: includes/Members/Rest.php:83
msgid "Saving is for members of this site."
msgstr "存檔只開放給本站會員。"

msgid "Daily fortune letter"
msgstr "每日運勢信"

msgid "Off: no signup form, nothing is sent."
msgstr "關閉：不顯示訂閱表單，不寄任何信。"

msgid "On, sent through FluentCRM (signup form [aw_oracle_daily], double opt-in, one letter a day at 07:00 in each subscriber’s time zone)."
msgstr "開啟，經 FluentCRM 寄出（訂閱表單 [aw_oracle_daily]、雙重確認、每位訂閱者當地時間 07:00 後每天一封）。"

msgid "FluentCRM is not active: the signup form is hidden and nothing is sent."
msgstr "FluentCRM 未啟用：訂閱表單不顯示，也不寄信。"

msgid "AWORACLE_DATA_KEY is missing (see Member data below): the signup form shows that subscribing is not available."
msgstr "缺少 AWORACLE_DATA_KEY（見下方「會員資料」）：訂閱表單會顯示目前無法訂閱。"

msgid "Resend webhook URL (events email.bounced, email.complained):"
msgstr "Resend webhook 網址（事件 email.bounced、email.complained）："

msgid "signing secret set."
msgstr "簽章密鑰已設定。"

msgid "set its signing secret in wp-config.php: define( 'AWORACLE_RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET', 'whsec_…' );"
msgstr "請在 wp-config.php 設定簽章密鑰：define( 'AWORACLE_RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET', 'whsec_…' );"

msgid "Confirm your daily fortune letter"
msgstr "請確認訂閱每日運勢信"

msgid "Someone (hopefully you) asked to receive a daily fortune letter at this address. Open this address and press the button to confirm. If it was not you, ignore this message."
msgstr "有人（希望是您）要求用這個信箱收每日運勢信。請開啟下面的網址並按按鈕確認。如果不是您本人，忽略這封信即可。"

msgid "This confirmation link is not valid."
msgstr "這個確認連結無效。"

msgid "Press the button to start receiving the daily fortune letter."
msgstr "按下按鈕，開始收每日運勢信。"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "確認"

msgid "Confirmed. Your first letter arrives after 07:00 in your time zone."
msgstr "已確認。第一封信會在您所在時區早上 07:00 之後寄到。"

msgid "This confirmation link has expired or was already used."
msgstr "這個確認連結已過期或已用過。"

msgid "Subscribing is not available on this site yet."
msgstr "本站目前還不能訂閱。"

msgid "Almost done: check your inbox and confirm your e-mail address."
msgstr "快完成了：請到信箱收信，確認您的 email。"

msgid "Too many requests. Try again in an hour."
msgstr "請求太多次，請一小時後再試。"

msgid "Your daily fortune for %s"
msgstr "%s 每日運勢"

msgid "Here is today’s reading, calculated from your birth chart."
msgstr "這是依您的命盤算出的今日運勢。"

msgid "Overall"
msgstr "整體"

msgid "Love"
msgstr "感情"

msgid "Career"
msgstr "事業"

msgid "Wealth"
msgstr "財運"

msgid "Health"
msgstr "健康"

msgid "Lucky colours:"
msgstr "幸運色："

msgid "Lucky numbers:"
msgstr "幸運數字："

msgid "Lucky direction:"
msgstr "幸運方位："

msgid "Good for:"
msgstr "宜："

msgid "Avoid:"
msgstr "忌："

msgid "You receive this because you subscribed to the daily fortune. Use the unsubscribe link below to stop it."
msgstr "您收到這封信，是因為您訂閱了每日運勢。要停止，請按下方的取消訂閱連結。"

msgid "AwareWave daily fortune signup"
msgstr "AwareWave 每日運勢訂閱"

msgid "Daily fortune by e-mail"
msgstr "每日運勢 email"

msgid "One letter every morning after 07:00 in your time zone, calculated from your birth data. You can unsubscribe from any letter."
msgstr "每天早上 07:00（您所在時區）之後寄一封，依您的出生資料計算。每封信都可以取消訂閱。"

msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "Email"

msgid "Your time zone (type to search)"
msgstr "您所在的時區（可輸入搜尋）"

msgid "Birthplace time zone (e.g. Asia/Taipei)"
